Welcome to Ganymede, Lieutenant. As you are probably aware, yesterday we lost three Grizzlies and several Scavengers; there is no trace of them to be found anywhere. You and your men are to proceed to their last reported co-ordinates and mount a reconnaissance patrol to look for the missing units. NSDF Command suspects Russian involvement, but without any wreckage or survivors, we cannot prove a thing.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Build a base and search for the missing platoon.